(40091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Arch Druid Staghelm will be overjoyed to hear such news! Please, on behalf of the Cenarion Circle, take one of these items.', 0),
(40147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is truly an accomplishment to be celebrated. For what you\'ve done within the Crescent Grove, please take one of these. May they assist you well in your future endeavors.', 0);
